{
  "name": "NGO Donor Reports & Donation Receipts \u2014 v2",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## NGO Report Desk \u2014 separate backend\n1. Assign credentials to Webhook, OmniRoute model, Gmail, WhatsApp and every Meta node.\n2. Publish; POST to /webhook/ngo-report-desk-v1 from your server with header authentication. Never expose that credential in browser code.\n3. One action per request: draft / gmail / whatsapp / facebook / instagram / receipt_preview.\n4. Private delivery requires approved=true + approved_text. Social requires public_approved=true + public_text; Instagram also needs a public HTTPS image_url.\n5. Existing WhatsApp inbound bot is NOT replaced. Forward an authenticated request from its current workflow.\n6. No scheduled sends, no automatic retry, no tax claims. No durable duplicate protection; never blindly retry an uncertain delivery.\n7. Import schema and live channels must be tested on your installed n8n version.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "350baaf1-2676-4935-89b2-5e76bd257f3f",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
